  "summary": {
    "en": {
      "caveats": "The study is a localized, qualitative ethnography focused on a specific demographic group in a single city during the year 2010.",
      "what": "This book-length ethnography examines the intersection of emerging mobile media, urban space, and sociality among young, White, aspiring middle-class residents in Berlin around 2010.",
      "why": "It documents how early mobile social networking technologies reshaped physical urban navigation and social networks during a specific transitional era in Berlin's post-reunification history."
